member.remarks:
Ghidra identifies the retail task as BinocularOverlay_Draw, with separate compass and
distance handlers. The binocular sprite is therefore drawn in place of the ordinary weapon HUD;
the camera and zoom state remain owned by .

remarks.para:
The human's handler then adds the bottom-filled health power bar and any timed-interaction progress;
StatusScreen::Render finishes with the authored LevelFlow countdown. The map computer is
a separate screen and remains owned by .
